## Multi-page parallel workflow

```
// 1. Get all capture IDs at once
captureId1 = generate_figma_design(fileKey)   // page 1
captureId2 = generate_figma_design(fileKey)   // page 2

// 2. Run Playwright captures in background simultaneously
Bash(capture-page1.js, run_in_background=true)
Bash(capture-page2.js, run_in_background=true)

// 3. Poll both until completed
generate_figma_design(fileKey, captureId1) → poll loop
generate_figma_design(fileKey, captureId2) → poll loop

// 4. Add components to each capture frame
use_figma → add to captureFrame1
use_figma → add to captureFrame2
```

